    <headline>Heavy Rain Risk Area</headline>
    <description>The weak southwest monsoon prevailing over the Andaman Sea, Thailand and the Gulf while the southerly and southeasterly winds prevail over the lower South. Isolated thundershowers are forecast in the country while isolated heavy rain is possible in the South.  The moderate wind and waves in the upper Andaman Sea are expected 1-2 meters high and above 2 meters high in thundershowers. </description>
    <instruction>People in the South should beware of heavy rain and accumulation.  All ships in the Andaman Sea and the Gulf should keep off thundershowers.
</instruction>
